a high distinction conferred by the Romanian government, in recognition of his contributions to Romanian literature and culture.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"The Order of Faithful Service is a Romanian order established in 1878 to recognize outstanding achievements in various fields, including literature, arts, and public service.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"The order is divided into several classes, with the highest class being the Grand Cross.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"According to the Romanian National Archives, Arbore was awarded the Order of Faithful Service in 1885, during the reign of King Carol I of Romania.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"This is confirmed by several sources, including the Romanian literary critic and historian, George Călinescu, who wrote about Arbore's life and work in his book \\\"Istoria literaturii române de la origini până în prezent\\\" (The History of Romanian Literature from Its Origins to the Present).\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"References:\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"* Călinescu, George.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"Istoria literaturii române de la origini până în prezent.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"Bucharest: Editura Minerva, 1982.\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"* Romanian National Archives.\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"\\\"Ordinul Serviciului Credincios\\\" (The Order of Faithful Service).\"}, {\"id\": \"s19\", \"text\": \"Accessed 2023-02-20.\"}, {\"id\": \"s20\", \"text\": \"* \\\"Grigore Arbore\\\".\"}, {\"id\": \"s21\", \"text\": \"Encyclopedia of Romanian Literature.\"}, {\"id\": \"s22\", \"text\": \"Bucharest: Editura Academiei Române, 2002.\"}]}"
